{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『有了喜歡的人。』", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2472", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "櫻乃那樣說之後過了幾天。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "從那天起櫻乃的態度……完全沒變。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那句話是真心的嗎？還是「喜歡的人」的意思，跟我以為的不一樣……？", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之櫻乃表現得跟平常一樣。", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對，櫻乃的態度沒有變。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "改變的……是我。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一直很在意那句話，在意櫻乃的態度。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前她從來沒說過這種事情。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然只是我自己覺得，但櫻乃好像對戀愛沒什麼興趣……", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你的表情很有趣喔。」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ht1026", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但是笑不出來吧？」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼嘛，有自覺啊。」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ht1027", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，有什麼事嗎？」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「已經午休了，你沒有注意到嗎？」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "ht1028", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我環顧四周，教室裡一片熱鬧吵雜。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "咦……？", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的課是上什麼？", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你怎麼了，一直發呆。該不會是感冒了？」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5250", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我沒有不舒服。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就快點走了。學生食堂會沒位子。」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "sn2135", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃也先去等我們了。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5251", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……嗯，也對。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5252", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「變冷了呢。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5253", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理縮了縮肩膀。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「風變冷了，與其說秋天感覺已經是冬天了。」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2473", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然不討厭冬天，但是今年好像會討厭了。」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5254", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……暖氣費？」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2474", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「意外地很貴喔。從家裡拿毛毯來好了。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5255", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家也有，需要的話給妳用吧？」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2475", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也好，如果需要我會問妳的。」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5256", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，隨時都可以跟我說。」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2476", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，櫻乃真的很平常的樣子呢。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5257", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我喜歡現在這種溫度。」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2477", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣啊，有點羨慕妳呢。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5258", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理，不喜歡？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2478", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不適應這種溫度。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5259", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我抱緊妳吧？」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2479", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種事，妳去對瓜生君做吧。」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5260", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊唔……」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2480", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……妳好像變得更熱了。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5261", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「臉，發熱了。」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2481", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果對瓜生君也是這種反應，應該立刻就會被發現了吧。」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5262", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在哥哥面前，我表現得很普通。」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2482", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……辦得到嗎？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5263", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「靠氣勢跟毅力。」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2483", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這兩個詞都感覺跟櫻乃無緣呢。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5264", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前想表現得普通但是失敗了。」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2484", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要去想好像是最好的。」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2485", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「順其自然就對了？」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5265", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2486", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，好像沒有很順利喔。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5266", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2487", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，為什麼妳知道？我跟平常一樣吧。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2488", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君的態度。」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5267", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格，有什麼奇怪嗎？」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2489", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像回到之前在煩惱什麼的時候一樣，一直在想事情。」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5268", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生君對其他事情都能笑著處理，只有一件事深深煩惱著。」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5269", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，這也表示那究竟有多特別啦……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5270", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理看著我。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以說，櫻乃，妳對瓜生君做什麼了吧？」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5271", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……我對葛格說我有喜歡的人了。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2490", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊，他怎麼回答？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5272", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是。我只對葛格說『有喜歡的人』而已。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2491", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5273", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理一臉驚訝。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都說到那樣了還不告訴他啊？」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5274", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然……還是說不出口。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2492", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然我懂妳的心情。」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5275", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她苦笑了一下。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是看瓜生君的反應，感覺現在立刻告訴他也沒關係的說。」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5276", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是嗎？」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2493", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然只是我自己這麼認為。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5277", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……要決定的人是我自己？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2494", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對。不過我隨時可以聽妳商量喔。」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5278", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有什麼我能幫忙的事情嗎？」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5279", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……因為這是我第一次戀愛，希望妳教我該做什麼才好。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2495", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5280", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理的話，一定戀愛經驗豐富。」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2496", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有那種事喔。我……那個……」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5281", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理也跟我一樣？」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2497", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……沒錯。不，或許我比櫻乃更沒經驗。」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5282", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我又沒有喜歡上誰過。」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5283", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有點驚訝。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2498", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是這種時候，該怎麼辦呢？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5284", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「知己知彼，百戰百勝。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2499", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然不太對，但好像相去不遠呢。」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5285", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以只要知道葛格的事，一定就沒問題。」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2500", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我覺得沒有女孩子比櫻乃更瞭解瓜生君了。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5286", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格的事，我也不是全部都知道。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2501", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以妳才會總是看著瓜生君嗎？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5287", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……有一直看著嗎？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2502", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳沒有自覺？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5288", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "溫柔的微笑。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，妳的眼神總是追著瓜生君喔。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5289", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果真的一直看，葛格應該會注意到。」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2503", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果從小就一直那樣呢？」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5290", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2504", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「至少，從我跟櫻乃第一次見面的時候起，妳就一直是那樣了。」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5291", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我沒有意識到。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2505", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一開始我只以為是『喜歡哥哥的妹妹』而已。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5292", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以瓜生君也沒注意到吧？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5293", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很有道理……」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5294", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過最近的櫻乃看起來有戀愛中少女的感覺就是了。」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5295", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理在調侃我？」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2506", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是。首先要知己，對吧？」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5296", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……的確，或許我知道了不認識的自己。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2507", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以說，接下來去知道敵人瓜生君就好了。」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5297", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該怎麼做才好呢？」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2508", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛，比如說──」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 393, "voice": "ar5298", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。我知道了，好……」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呼……", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「電話？」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2509", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是瀨名同學。」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……這樣啊。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2510", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結女的人問了她很多事，為了省事她想整理好一次問我。」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「問葛格的事？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2511", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像是呢。」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣的話身為妹妹不能輸。我也想知道各種事。」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2512", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃連我自己沒注意的事都知道，應該沒有妳不知道的事情吧？」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格也知道我不知道的我，你知道我的全部嗎？」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2513", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是啊。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們是兄妹，同時也是男與女。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一定有很多彼此不知道的事情……", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也有很多無法知道的事吧。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，好像暫時會受到瀨名同學大量提問。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜歡的人的事……大家都想知道吧。」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 405, "voice": "sk2514", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在想喜歡的人的事嗎？", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為哥哥我應該祝福她。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "祝福櫻乃幸福。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我早就知道的，她總有一天會喜歡上某個人。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是呢……我也懂那種心情喔。」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 403, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_12.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我現在想知道的對象──", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
